      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1xgnnzz'
    '|a||Back where he started, with the same muffin, thirty cents poorer, and pleased at every step.':
