      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:9xykeb'
    '|a||Ten laps and his three dollars are gone. Economists call this a money pump.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:17cu71x'
    '|b||So a circle isn''t just untidy. It''s a standing invitation to be exploited.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5120
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1s1einp'
    '|a||Now change one thing: let Tom prefer the croissant to the muffin.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:h4c3nu'
    '|a||His circle becomes a ladder, croissant on top. Offer him anything for the croissant, and he says no. The pump stops.':
      mp3: 
