      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:wk07xt'
    '|a||That''s the case for transitivity: whoever''s preferences run in a circle can be led round it forever, paying each time.':
