      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:oarhvo'
    '|a||Write A, curly greater-or-equal, B for: A is at least as good as B.':
