      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:ynlz4r'
    '|a||Transitive: if A beats B and B beats C, A beats C.':
