      ms: 13120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1a4es0w'
    '|a||How sure are we? That reversals happen: consensus. That real preferences run in circles: contested.':
