      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1wd968j'
    '|a||So rational is a modest word: not selfish, not clever, just a ranking that hangs together, so nobody can lead you round in circles.':
