      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:2yqmlq'
    '|b||Four new cases. Kari gives a tenth of her pay to charity every year, whatever happens. Can an economist call her rational?':
